What is Eco-friendly Printing Ink?
Eco-friendly printing ink comprises sustainable alternatives to conventional petroleum-based inks, manufactured using renewable plant-derived oils such as soybean, sunflower, safflower, and cottonseed. These inks minimize volatile organic compound (VOC) emissions and reduce environmental impact, aligning with regulatory standards and corporate sustainability initiatives. Unlike traditional inks, they provide superior biodegradability and lower toxicity, making them ideal for packaging, commercial printing, and various other applications.
